                "evidence": "Cloudflare AI Search billing **starts 2026-12-01**. Every figure below comes from the vault page [[Cloudflare AI Search]], last reviewed 2026-11-01 from Cloudflare's pricing page. That's 6 days ago, inside its 30-day refresh window, so I didn't search the web again.\n\n**Free each month**\n- 5M ingestion tokens\n- 10 GB-month of storage\n- 1,000 semantic queries\n- 1,000 full-text queries\n\n**Cost beyond that**\n- $0.75 per 1,000 hybrid (vector + keyword) queries\n- $0.10 per 1,000 full-text queries\n\n**Limits**\n- Up to 50 results per query\n- Up to 5 custom metadata fields per instance\n\n**Gap in the source:** it doesn't give a price for ingestion tokens or storage beyond the free amounts. It also calls the free queries \"semantic\" but the paid ones \"hybrid.\" I'm guessing those mean the same thing, but the page doesn't say. Check Cloudflare's pricing page before you rely on what extra ingestion or storage would cost.\n\nSources checked: the research vault only. I didn't search the web or social sources because the vault page was recent enough."
